  "title": "Kitchen Sink Salad Dressing",
  "description": "We love the name, the taste and that everything goes into the blender. Lots of ingredients, like tomato soup, Worcestershire sauce, and brown sugar. Some make it hot, others make it sweet. The end result is a dressing that you 'll love to keep on hand and toss with your favorite salad.",
